// THE TWO TEST-LOCAL FACADE BUILDERS (stage 4b1 Task 13).
//
// systemDesignManager and projectDesignManager are GONE — their surviving bodies are
// methods on the one deliveryManager, and newDeliveryManager is the only production
// builder. These two keep the RETIRED BUILDERS' PARAMETER LISTS, in their order, purely
// so the ~110 existing cases over the folded catalog reads, the two slot-thread writes and
// the two phase seals did not have to be rewritten into a twenty-argument call that would
// pass nil for eighteen of them. They are TEST shapes and nothing in production has this
// shape: production threads the union once, through newDeliveryManager.
